 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Give",
   "texto": [
    "**dar com** (find): **Dei com a chave** (found the key). **dar por** (consider): **Dou-o por perdido** (I consider it lost). To note that something is missing, in European Portuguese it is very natural **dar pela falta de**: **Dei pela falta do livro** (I noted that the book was missing). **dar por falta de** is also found."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Ficar",
   "texto": [
    "**ficar com** (stay with): **Fico com o carro** (I'm keeping the car). **ficar por** (to be done): **Ficou por fazer** (to be done)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Pass",
   "texto": [
    "**passar por** (passing through a place or look): **Passei pela loja** (passing through the store). **passar a** + infinitive (start to): **Passei a trabalhar aqui** (I started working here). **passar de** (overcome): **Passou dos cinquenta** (passed from the fifty)."
   ]
  },
